" begin="00:21.410" end="00:25.160"><span begin="00:21.410" end="00:21.740">So </span><span begin="00:21.740" end="00:22.040">love </span><span begin="00:22.040" end="00:22.220">me </span><span begin="00:22.220" end="00:23.270">now </span><span begin="00:23.270" end="00:23.480">or </span><span begin="00:23.480" end="00:23.780">let </span><span begin="00:23.780" end="00:24.140">me </span><span begin="00:24.140" end="00:25.160">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.430" end="00:28.460"><span begin="00:25.430" end="00:25.700">Let </span><span begin="00:25.700" end="00:25.820">me </span><span begin="00:25.820" end="00:26.540">feel </span><span begin="00:26.540" end="00:26.840">these </span><span begin="00:26.840" end="00:27.560">high </span><span begin="00:27.560" end="00:27.650">and </span><span begin="00:27.650" end="00:28.460">lows</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.460" end="00:33.410"><span begin="00:28.460" end="00:29.180">Before </span><span begin="00:29.180" end="00:29.360">the </span><span begin="00:29.360" end="00:30.020">doors </span><span begin="00:30.020" end="00:30.170">to </span><span begin="00:30.170" end="00:30.650">my </span><span begin="00:30.650" end="00:31.640">heart </span><span begin="00:31.640" end="00:33.410">close</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.730" end="00:38.540"><span begin="00:34.730" end="00:35.450">Touch </span><span begin="00:35.450" end="00:35.960">me </span><span begin="00:35.960" end="00:38.540">someone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.140" end="00:41.660"><span begin="00:39.140" end="00:39.410">I'm </span><span begin="00:39.410" end="00:39.770">too </span><span begin="00:39.770" end="00:40.250">young </span><span begin="00:40.250" end="00:40.580">to </span><span begin="00:40.580" end="00:41.030">feel </span><span begin="00:41.030" end="00:41.660">so</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.660" end="00:45.710"><span begin="00:41.660" end="00:42.440">Numb </span><span begin="00:42.440" end="00:43.010">num